            <ArticleTitle>[Noninvasive determination of myocardial function in infarct patients].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>127-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a prospective study, the regional ventricular function was assessed by cross sectional echocardiography in 22 patients with coronary heart disease. When compared with angiocardiography, cross sectional echocardiography has proven to be a valuable tool for the evaluation of regional ventricular function.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
